{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bunny Guys!",
    "steam_appid": 2218460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb, fail, curse \u2013 all over again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bunny Guys is a merciless obstacle race for bunnies with nerves of steel. Whether solo or in online multiplayer with up to 8 players: only those with focus, precision, and perseverance will make it to the top; everyone else ends up... at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb dangerous courses, dodge nasty traps, and master tricky jumps. A small mistake can set you back a long way, but scattered checkpoints give you a breather before things get serious again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone, challenge your friends, or compete against others. The fastest finisher secures a place on the global leaderboard and will be rewarded with the Steam achievement &quot;Golden Bunny&quot; and an epic fireworks display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging climbing gameplay with few, fair checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer for up to 8 simultaneous players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboard with time comparison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Checkpoints, traps, and plenty of frustrating moments included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average playtime: 60\u2013120 minutes (depending on the number of falls)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How far will you get, and how often will you have to start all over again?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb, fail, curse \u2013 all over again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bunny Guys is a merciless obstacle race for bunnies with nerves of steel. Whether solo or in online multiplayer with up to 8 players: only those with focus, precision, and perseverance will make it to the top; everyone else ends up... at the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb dangerous courses, dodge nasty traps, and master tricky jumps. A small mistake can set you back a long way, but scattered checkpoints give you a breather before things get serious again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone, challenge your friends, or compete against others. The fastest finisher secures a place on the global leaderboard and will be rewarded with the Steam achievement &quot;Golden Bunny&quot; and an epic fireworks display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging climbing gameplay with few, fair checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer for up to 8 simultaneous players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global leaderboard with time comparison</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Checkpoints, traps, and plenty of frustrating moments included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average playtime: 60\u2013120 minutes (depending on the number of falls)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How far will you get, and how often will you have to start all over again?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Climb, fall, curse\u2014welcome to Bunny Guys! Whether alone or against others: only those who stay strong will make it to the top. The best end up in the rankings, everyone else... ends up at the bottom.",
